            "best_answer": true,
            "best_answer_content": "Hello,\n\nIt is not available in MX2. It needs to be configured manually in the debug register, **DBGMCU\\_APB1LFZR**, in particular. I invite you to check the reference manual, page 2543.\n\n![STackPointer64_0-1776951981484.png](https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/d94e2f02-6bf3-8fb8-dc51-fb14d3d640ae.png \"STackPointer64_0-1776951981484.png\")\n\nBest regards,",
            "best_answer_author": "STackPointer64",
            "best_answer_author_role": "ST Employee",
            "content_text": "Hello,\n\nIs there a setting in MX2 to enable/disable timer freezing during debugging? If not, what HAL APIs can be used for this purpose?\n\nThank you,\n\nGil",
